<title>DENMARK: Tele Danmark in Romanian GSM bid.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark in Romanian GSM bid.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish telecoms giant Tele Danmark said on Thursday that it was part of a consortium bidding for a licence to install and operate a GSM mobile phone network in Romania.</p>
</text>
